=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">환경공학전공</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">산업공학부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">에너지융합소재공학부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">신소재시스템공학부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">기계공학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">기계설계공학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">지능기계공학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">기전공학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">기계시스템공학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">컴퓨터공학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">소재디자인공학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">광시스템공학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">메디컬</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">IT</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">융합공학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">응용수학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">응용화학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">경영학과</span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table></span></span></font><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><o:p></o:p></span></font><p></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong></strong></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">2. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">접수마감 </span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2014</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">27</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">18</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시 까지 </span></font></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; </span></font></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-pa